                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Then I saw heaven opened, and behold, a white horse! He who sat upon it is called Faithful and True, and in righteousness he judges and makes war. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.10.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 10.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " His eyes are like a flame of fire, and on his head are many diadems; and he has a name inscribed which no one knows but himself. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is clad in a robe dipped in",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other ancient authorities read",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sprinkled with",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " blood, and the name by which he is called is The Word of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the armies of heaven, arrayed in fine linen, white and pure, followed him on white horses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 2.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " From his mouth issues a sharp sword with which to smite the nations, and he will rule them with a rod of iron; he will tread the wine press of the fury of the wrath of God the Almighty. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 10.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.2.47"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 2.47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " On his robe and on his thigh he has a name inscribed, King of kings and Lord of lords.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
