            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.39.17+EZK.39.18+EZK.39.19+EZK.39.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Then I saw an angel standing in the sun, and with a loud voice he called to all the birds that fly in midheaven, “Come, gather for the great supper of God, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to eat the flesh of kings, the flesh of captains, the flesh of mighty men, the flesh of horses and their riders, and the flesh of all men, both free and slave, both small and great.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I saw the beast and the kings of the earth with their armies gathered to make war against him who sits upon the horse and against his army. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the beast was captured, and with it the false prophet who in its presence had worked the signs by which he deceived those who had received the mark of the beast and those who worshiped its image. These two were thrown alive into the lake of fire that burns with sulphur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the rest were slain by the sword of him who sits upon the horse, the sword that issues from his mouth; and all the birds were gorged with their flesh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
